+# Pulseboard
+
+**Project ID**: 001-pulseboard  
+**Created**: 2026-08-11  
+**Status**: Draft — ready for clarification  
+**Scale**: Level 2  
+**Recipe**: None — the brief establishes a web product but makes no stack choice.
+
+---
+
+## Information Sources
+
+**Traceability**: This specification derives solely from [brief.md](../../../brief.md). It is a greenfield specification; no import or codebase-scan artifacts exist.
+
+**Information flow**:
+
+```text
+brief.md
